Source: paperweight-fonts
Section: fonts
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Alex Long <johnalexanderlong@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://github.com/jalexlong/paperweight-os
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: paperweight-fonts
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, fonts-symbola
Description: PaperweightOS Nerd Fonts — JetBrains Mono, Symbols, and Symbola
 Ships JetBrains Mono Nerd Font (Regular, Bold, Italic, BoldItalic, Medium,
 SemiBold, and Mono variants) and the Nerd Fonts Symbols-Only font, providing
 full Nerd Font glyph coverage for terminals, waybar, and editors.
 .
 Depends on fonts-symbola to cover Unicode Miscellaneous Technical symbols
 (U+2300–U+23FF) that Nerd Fonts omit, including characters used by tools
 such as Claude Code for mode indicators.
 .
 Nerd fonts are sourced from https://github.com/ryanoasis/nerd-fonts and
 licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1.
